  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l005": "ары read as possessed ар, dromedary (Yudakhin ар II = нар I), not the directional adverb. Red-tailed retained. https://el-sozduk.kg/ар/",
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l009": "Чалыяр retained as personified proper Chalyyar. Edition glossary1834:l008–010 explains the four companions; singular epic presentation not expanded into four new persons.",
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l012": "керик = rhinoceros, edition glossary1839:l012; бил = elephant, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/бил/. Both creatures retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l014": "дүм read as fearsome presence/force: https://el-sozduk.kg/дүм/.",
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l020": "кынжы: wooden dog-restraint fitted about the neck, edition glossary1840:l007. Restraining yokes is a functional English gloss; no invented chains.",
    "manas-2010:p0721:b001:l029": "теңи provisionally half the champions; тең also admits equal/match. Awkward local quantity retained as a qualified reading.",
    "manas-2010:p0722:b001:l002": "тутанып өлгөн rendered as an imprecation, may he burn to death; Alöökö is alive in the narrative.",
    "manas-2010:p0722:b001:l033": "момо токоч: steamed unsalted round bread, edition glossary1841:l003. ылаңман contextually read as lagman, hand-pulled noodles; initial-vowel source form unchanged. https://el-sozduk.kg/лагман/",
    "manas-2010:p0722:b001:l042": "Lexical correction: таш сайынган means a Chinese/Kalmyk official wearing a distinguishing ball/button on the cap, Yudakhin таш I.5 https://el-sozduk.kg/таш/. In this formula таза means finest, not bald/shaven: Yudakhin таза3 https://el-sozduk.kg/ТАЗ/. Raw source unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0723:b001:l010": "ак үйлүү rendered hostage-taking rather than white dwelling. Manas encyclopedia explicitly describes Alöökö demanding Kyrgyz hostages: https://el-sozduk.kg/ак%20үйлүү/",
    "manas-2010:p0723:b001:l016": "көк contextually rawhide binding, not the color blue; qualified material reading.",
    "manas-2010:p0723:b001:l028": "Printed Казанбактай калай ат is defective or lexically uncertain. Draft provisionally reads the predicate as калдайат (bulged); no claim of recovered text. казанбак is a lattice/basket carrier for a cauldron, https://el-sozduk.kg/казанбак/; калдай III describes bulk/projection, https://el-sozduk.kg/калдай/. Raw калай ат preserved in extraction; qualified reconstruction needs another witness.",
    "manas-2010:p0724:b001:l002": "даңгыт: large fierce dog/mastiff, edition glossary1836:l028.",
    "manas-2010:p0724:b001:l027": "түмөндөп rendered vast hosts as epic multitude language; no exact invented census.",
    "manas-2010:p0725:b001:l014": "сүт кымыран means staring dazed, not a literal milk preparation, edition glossary1842:l033.",
    "manas-2010:p0725:b001:l025": "кара көк here resolute/fearless, dictionary2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/кара%20көк/.",
    "manas-2010:p0725:b001:l037": "Акыл айран бөлүнүп describes bewilderment; pronoun reference is contextually inferred, not explicit in the line.",
    "manas-2010:p0726:b001:l003": "The unfamiliar form belongs to the surrounding supernatural vision; the source syntax leaves the immediate antecedent implicit.",
    "manas-2010:p0726:b001:l007": "Чолок көк жал арслан retained as a short-tailed wolf-maned lion; not harmonized to the preceding guardian animal.",
    "manas-2010:p0726:b001:l017": "Зымырык is a mythical bird, edition glossary1838:l006; proper name Zymyryk retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0726:b001:l020": "чилтен = forty guardian saints, glossary1840:l008–009. Кызыр Ныязы provisionally proper Kydyr Niyaz, not an independently identified historical person.",
    "manas-2010:p0726:b001:l030": "House-sized red willow preserved as the literal supernatural image; not silently replaced by a banner.",
    "manas-2010:p0728:b001:l010": "Your tent retains source second-person possessive чатырың despite the surrounding narrative of Alöökö.",
    "manas-2010:p0728:b001:l017": "коруп read as guarding; realm supplied from the territorial boast. Qualified implicit object.",
    "manas-2010:p0729:b001:l031": "сары изине чөп сал idiom rendered relentless pursuit, not literal grass laying.",
    "manas-2010:p0729:b001:l039": "алеңгир жаа = destructive/devastating bow, dictionaries1969/2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/алеңгир/.",
    "manas-2010:p0730:b001:l007": "бил elephant, hence elephant-hide drum, https://el-sozduk.kg/бил/.",
    "manas-2010:p0730:b001:l020": "калдай historical administrative rank rendered governors; Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калдай/.",
    "manas-2010:p0730:b001:l025": "кара жолтой read ill-omened, not fortunate; historical epic sense.",
    "manas-2010:p0730:b001:l027": "керней and сурнай rendered long trumpet and reed horn, respectively; distinct instruments retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0731:b001:l002": "Two men together provisionally relates to loading the preceding booty; the object is implicit and the riding context also remains possible.",
    "manas-2010:p0731:b001:l028": "себил = armor/weapons, glossary1842:l024–025. Eighty-four provisionally counts equipment pieces; source does not explicitly supply pieces.",
    "manas-2010:p0731:b001:l030": "Бозкисе rendered Gray Belt as a named belt; кисе is a belt with attached pouches, not a wrist ornament.",
    "manas-2010:p0732:b001:l018": "Aksy retained as the named land in the narrative; no assertion that this etiological geography matches modern boundaries.",
    "manas-2010:p0732:b001:l025": "жан аябай concerns not sparing their own lives in the fighting; correction made in alignment.",
    "manas-2010:p0733:b001:l017": "жөлөнүп retained as leaning into the enveloping dust, an awkward image rather than an emended verb.",
    "manas-2010:p0733:b001:l022": "Unusual printed split Алөөкөнү алганда Арслан / Манас төрөнүн retained as two provisional display units, with English syntax continuing across the boundary.",
    "manas-2010:p0733:b001:l032": "үзүк is a felt roof-cover; exaggerated comparison of Shuutu’s cap retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0733:b001:l041": "Five emblems and five or six locations in the next line retained without numerical reconciliation.",
    "manas-2010:p0734:b001:l016": "машайык rendered spiritual elders rather than an opaque rank transliteration.",
    "manas-2010:p0734:b001:l029": "Ич этинен ок өтпөс provisionally describes the armor preventing bullets reaching inner flesh; armor is implicit from кийген in the following line.",
    "manas-2010:p0734:b001:l042": "Чоюн алп retained as proper Choyun Alp (literally cast-iron giant); shortened Choyun elsewhere refers to the same named figure.",
    "manas-2010:p0735:b001:l018": "The fragment continuing through l021 invokes inherited lore about Bakay. Case structure remains qualified; no additional episode or speaker invented.",
    "manas-2010:p0735:b001:l025": "Eighty below and ninety above retained. At736:l037–038 the source reverses these allocations; neither occurrence harmonized.",
    "manas-2010:p0735:b001:l027": "экөө provisionally the two groups of giants, not two newly introduced individual combatants.",
    "manas-2010:p0736:b001:l002": "керүү provisionally ridge/upland in the geographic setting; no modern geographic identification asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0736:b001:l015": "Ат салышкан жеке жок provisionally an absolute boast that nobody matched Choyun in mounted combat; paired with no forehead left unsplit.",
    "manas-2010:p0736:b001:l024": "Кер ат rendered bay horse; source capitalization alone does not prove an independent proper name.",
    "manas-2010:p0736:b001:l037": "Eighty above/ninety below preserved, reversing735:l025–026 as printed.",
    "manas-2010:p0737:b001:l004": "карап кылып means laying waste/ruining, not watching. https://el-sozduk.kg/карап/",
    "manas-2010:p0737:b001:l032": "Wolf’s way preserves бөрү жолдуу martial epithet; not a newly named order or tribe.",
    "manas-2010:p0737:b001:l035": "күрмө rendered sleeveless coat, the historical garment, rather than a rank name.",
    "manas-2010:p0737:b001:l036": "Lexical correction: таш сайынган means a Chinese/Kalmyk official wearing a distinguishing ball/button on the cap, Yudakhin таш I.5 https://el-sozduk.kg/таш/. In this formula таза means finest, not bald/shaven: Yudakhin таза3 https://el-sozduk.kg/ТАЗ/. Raw source unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0737:b001:l038": "Repeated claims of total slaughter retained; later escape of Alöökö and companions not used to rewrite these repetitions.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l012": "Кызыкты кымбат кылдырып provisionally making the excitement costly; local causal phrasing remains uncertain rather than expanded into an invented event.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l014": "торко silk; желбегей describes the robe draped over shoulders without putting arms through sleeves. https://el-sozduk.kg/торко/",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l015": "желбеген жорго retained as a pacer that does not trot: pacing and trotting are distinct gaits.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l016": "Parenthesis through l017 is narrated verse, not an editorial prose note. Sixty Manchus and forty nobles retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l020": "күн жайлап weather-conjuring sorcery, not resting for a day.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l032": "Burn to death is an imprecation; not a report that the escaping Alöökö has already died.",
    "manas-2010:p0738:b001:l041": "чогоол fearsome/formidable in the gun formula, https://el-sozduk.kg/чогоол/.",
    "manas-2010:p0739:b001:l014": "каркыбар rendered brave men; Oirat ethnonym retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0739:b001:l020": "Көрөгөчү provisionally epithet far-seeing qualifying Dangyl; https://el-sozduk.kg/көрөгөчү/. List names fewer than the stated twelve; no invented names added.",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l004": "олпок padded protective coat; armor context informs following fiber image.",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l005": "Казанбактай булалар provisionally masses of fiber as large as cauldron-baskets, from torn padding/cloth in l004. була can denote fiber or costly cloth; precise object uncertain. Basket image retained, no invented heads/scalps. https://el-sozduk.kg/казанбак/",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l018": "Long printed line retained as one extracted verse unit. сан кол rendered vast army as an epic multitude expression, no exact invented census.",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l022": "Source literally suggests carrying away the gold; no unsupported negative inserted to make the champions prevent its removal.",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l023": "Forty champions retained though twelve have already been sent ahead; no arithmetic correction.",
    "manas-2010:p0740:b001:l033": "Struggling with the horses’ mouths represents rein/bit control; literal source image retained."
